You can also generate a function body from just its definition (any name, even if it’s not
very descriptive) and an inline comment, which the model uses to generate the code:
def increment_elements(int_list):
    """
        Return list with elements incremented by 1
    """
This generates something like the following:
def increment_elements(int_list):
    """
        Return list with elements incremented by 1
    """
    for i in range(len(int_list)):
        int_list[i]+=1
    return int_list
